# 2. 

| Method | Path        | Description                                |
| GET    | /health     | Liveness check for the REST service itself |
| GET    | /items      | List all items                             |
| GET    | /items/<id> | Get a single item by id                    |
| POST   | /items      | Create a new item                          |

# 2. compose and start the services 

# To the file directory. eg. cd DSA_semester_project

docker compose up --build

# 3. 
docker compose down

# 4. start/stop a single container

docker start/stop container_ID

# 5. Create an Item - postman

http://localhost:8085/items?Content-Type=application/json

{
  "name": "Arista_CSV Conference",
  "status": "open",
  "location": "Frankfurt",
  "date": "Sep.30.2026 - Oct.10.2026"
}

# 6. GET Item

http://localhost:8085/items?Content-Type=application/json

# 7. GET Item by ID

http://localhost:8085/items/12

